{"3127770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ACE Strategy: Mecha Nova", "steam_appid": 3127770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/642a06578ac0364fe309a1e6ceb50c9c.avif?t=1784516877\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in the Z1 Galaxy, at the Beichen Orbital Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an interstellar courier, ferrying supplies between orbital stations, outposts, and private supply depots. Life on Beichen Star was peaceful — almost tedious — until crisis struck without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/d81d7d899b898dea4728a8a02b9601af.poster.avif?t=1784516877\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/d81d7d899b898dea4728a8a02b9601af.webm?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/d81d7d899b898dea4728a8a02b9601af.mp4?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your shift, communications with the outpost suddenly go dark. Duncan 76 — the outpost engineer and the galaxy's most beloved clone — has vanished. The entire galaxy plunges into emergency as a pirate invasion looms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You receive orders from the Station Commander: head to the outpost and investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/0eebdf4fa0523185aee0e9ae50751736.avif?t=1784516877\" width=780 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/74eef109e94a7a00a1d911e66cf3f5e8.avif?t=1784516877\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Core Gameplay】</strong> · <strong>Exclusive Mecha:</strong> Board your personal mecha and rewrite the rules of the battlefield. Every command you issue translates directly into battlefield action. · <strong>3×3 Strategic Layout:</strong> The art of war within a nine-cell grid. Command up to 9 combat units and activate circuit abilities through precise deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/99e74015a40aa6cba3551be9f2e61084.poster.avif?t=1784516877\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/99e74015a40aa6cba3551be9f2e61084.webm?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/99e74015a40aa6cba3551be9f2e61084.mp4?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Deck Building】</strong> · <strong>Mecha Enhancement:</strong> Grow stronger with every battle. Collect Chip cards to permanently upgrade mecha performance, pair with item cards to adapt to real-time combat situations, and forge your unique combat style. · <strong>Card Combat:</strong> The brutal aesthetics of tactical execution. Turn strategic plans into decisive victories on the battlefield — experience the direct feedback between decision and execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/559af17ae395c55e66b8c4fe92352102.poster.avif?t=1784516877\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/559af17ae395c55e66b8c4fe92352102.webm?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/559af17ae395c55e66b8c4fe92352102.mp4?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Roguelite Deck Building】</strong> · <strong>Route Selection:</strong> Chart your enhancement path. Every choice reshapes your mecha's evolution, creating your own ace combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/bcb8f7d79073db64c0bf34763b3eba5b.poster.avif?t=1784516877\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/bcb8f7d79073db64c0bf34763b3eba5b.webm?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/bcb8f7d79073db64c0bf34763b3eba5b.mp4?t=1784516877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/642a06578ac0364fe309a1e6ceb50c9c.avif?t=1784516877\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in the Z1 Galaxy, at the Beichen Orbital Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an interstellar courier, ferrying su